# ESLint / Prettier

Sources: `docs/NAMING.md`, `docs/FRONTEND_FSD.md`, `docs/BACKEND_STRUCTURE.md`, root `.prettierrc.json`.

## Prettier (do not fight the formatter)

- double quotes, semicolons, `trailingComma: "all"`, `printWidth: 80`, LF
- Run `pnpm format` before finishing large edits; CI runs `pnpm format:check`
- Do not hand-format in a conflicting style

## ESLint boundaries

- **Frontends** (`eslint/fsd-boundaries.mjs`): import only downward FSD layers; no cross-slice imports between `_pages` / `features` / `entities`
- **API** (`eslint/nest-boundaries.mjs`): a domain may not deep-import another domain; cross-domain only via `*.module.ts` (+ `common` / `prisma`)
- Do not disable boundary rules with eslint-comments unless fixing a false positive and documenting why

## Scripts

- `pnpm lint` — ESLint in all packages
- `pnpm format` / `pnpm format:check` — Prettier
- `pnpm syncpack:check` — aligned dependency versions
- pre-commit (husky): lint-staged → eslint --fix + prettier --write on staged files
